    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abusalomu kūlombelwa ashoke kaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu ng'wana Seluya ūdeeba gīkī ī ng'holò ya ntemi yankūmbūlile ū Abusalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yoabu ūtūma munhū kūja Tekoa, ūkenha kūfuma koi nkīma nebe, ng'witegeleja mu kayombele. Aho washika ūng'wīla, “Igīmbījage kūbiza gītī ūlī mu shikū ja kūnīla munhū waacha; ūzwale shizwalo sha koolecha gīkī ūlī mu kūlīla ng'hūngū. Yaya ū kwibila nūūlū maguta ga būlenji, ūbize gītī ūlī nkīma alī na shikū ningī akūūnīlaga munhū waacha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūje ū kūlī ntemi ūkahaye yīyī mihayo.” Ū Yoabu ūnangīīla ū nkīma ī mihayo yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma wa Tekoa aho washika ū kū būtongi wa ntemi ūtuja mazwi kūlwa koolecha ikūjo, hanuma winama kūshisha ū būshū būkuumya hasī. Hūna ūhaya, “Baba ntemi, nigunanhage!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntemi nang'hwe ūmūja, “Ūlī na makoye kī?” Ū nkīma ūhaya, “Baba nalī nchīlwa, ū ngoshi wane wamala kūzumalīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū nene nsese wako nūlekelwa bitūnja babīlī, alīyo lūshikū lūmò bikenya balī kū malaale, al'īkī walī atīko munhū wa kūbayangūla, ūmò ūntūla ū ng'wiye ūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo lūūlū ī haha, ū lūganda ū lose lwanigaaganīlile ū nene nsese wako; pye a bose bakūhayaga gīkī, ‘Nfunyage ū ng'witūnja wako ūyo wamūlagile ū ng'wiye, nang'hwe abūlagwe kūlwa nguno ya kūmūlaga ū ng'wiye.’ Alīyo ūlū balīte gīko bakūnikonola gete, nguno bakūbamala lūūlū a bingīji; balījimye nī likala ī līmò īlo naasaagījiwe. Ū ngoshi wane batūnekela lina nūūlū shibyalīlwe ū mu sī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūhaya, “Shokaga kaya lūūlū nakūfunya shilagīlo sha kūkūgunanha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū nkīma wa Tekoa ūhaya, “Baba ntemi, ū būbi ni būnigwīlage nene hamò na kaya ya ng'wa baba, ū ntemi ū ng'wene abize atī na shilingo pyī nī lisumbī lyakwe lya būtemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūshosha, “Ose ose ūyo alakwenhele mihayo ng'wenhage kūlī nene; atūshokeela hangī ū kūkūkwīgīja mihayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ūhaya, “Ū ntemi ni ilahīlage mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wakwe, gīkī akūng'hangīja ū maji wa shiilī atizongeja kūtūūla būkenaagūji higūlya ya būkenaagūji; atizūyagajiwa ū ng'witūnja wane!” Ū ntemi ūhaya, “Nalīkwilahīlīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA mpanga, gīkī lūtūūlagala hasī nūūlū lūywīlī lūmò kūfuma ū kū ntwe gwa ng'witūnja wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūhaya, “Nchīlage shigongo ū nsese wako ayombe mhayo ū kūlī baba būgonzo ū ntemi.” Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Yombaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūhaya, “Alilūūlū baba ntemi, nibūlī wabīītīlile mhayo gūlī gīko a banhū ba ng'wa Mululungu? Ī gīsī ū ntemi ūlū wahaya ūmo wahayīla gīko, atikaanīlaga būhūbi wei ng'wenekīlī, īkī atūnshoshaga ū ng'witūnja wakwe ūyo wamponya kūle? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī chene ng'hana tūhelelilwe icha pye a bose; h'ūmo galī na a minzī, ayo gatayoolagwa ūlū gūlinda gidīka hasī. Gwike ū Mulungu atīngījaga banhū būpanga, ū wei akabeejaga nzīla ya kūngunanha ūyo alī kūle, atizikala akwibonaga gīkī aponyiwe, na gūtīho gwa kwīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, naabona hambū hambū nize nīsomboole ī yīnīyī ū kūlī baba būgonzo ū ntemi, īkī nose a banhū babizagūnogohya. Ū nene nsese wako niganikile nūbona gīkī, ‘Ī gete nayombe ū kūlī ntemi, hamo adūgije kūzunya ū kwīyīta īyo alalombe ū nsese wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamo ū ntemi akūzunya ū kūmpīja ū nsese wakwe ū mu nkono go ng'wa munhū ūyo alī na ng'hūmbū ja kūniyagaja ū nene nū ng'witūnja wane twīnge ū mu wingīji ūbo Mulungu watwinha.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būlombi wa nsese wako ī haha būlī gīkī, ‘Ū mhayo go ng'wa baba būgonzo ū ntemi gūniifuuje ho nane, nguno ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi, abange gītī malaika o ng'wa Mulungu ū mu kwīdeeba ī yawiza nī mibi. Na lūūlū leka ū SEEBA Mulungu wako abize hamò nang'ho.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abusalomu kūzunīlījiwa kūshoka Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya būsombooji wenūbo ū ntemi ūng'wīla ū nkīma, “Ūtizūnibisa ī lishosho ly'ibūjo īlo nalīhaya kūkūbūūja.” Ū nkīma ūhaya, “Ni ahayage dūhū ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūbūūja, “Ū nkono go ng'wa Yoabu gūtī hamò nang'ho ū mu yose yenīyī?” Ū nkīma ūshosha ūhaya, “Oodala gīt'ūmo īlī gete baba būgonzo ntemi wane; atīho wa kūgalūka akaja kū nkono gwa būlyo nūūlū gwa lūmoso wīleka īyo wīhaya ū ntemi ū baba būgonzo. Watūngīlīja baba, na ng'wene ng'hana ū Yoabu ū ntūmami wako ūyo wanilangīīlile ū kwīyīta ī yenīyī, nī mihayo yose yenīyī wītūūla ū mu nomo gwa nsese wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntūmami wako ū Yoabu wītile ī yenīyī kūlwa kūhaya kūgalūcha ūmo kalī a kajīle ka mihayo a ka haha. Ū baba būgonzo īkī alī na masala gītī malaika o ng'wa Mulungu, īīmanile pyī ī mihayo ūmo īkūjīlaga ū mu sī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūng'wīla ū Yoabu, “Nazunyaga ū kūgwīta ū mhayo gwenūyū; jaga ūkang'wenhe ū nsūmba ū Abusalomu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu ūtuja mazwi koolecha ikūjo, hanuma winama kūshisha ū būshū būkuumya hasī; ūnūmba no ū ntemi; ūhaya, “Ī lelo ū ntūmami wako hū waadeeba gīkī gashi anukūlilwe ū mu miso gako baba būgonzo ntemi, nguno ū ntemi wazunya ū kūng'wītīla ū ntūmami wakwe gīt'ūmo kalī kalombele kakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoabu aho wīnga a henaho, ūja ī Geshuli kūng'wenha Yelusalemu ū Abusalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntemi ūhaya, “Ni ajage akikale kū ng'wakwe, yaya ū kūshika ū kū būtongi wane.” Na ng'hana ū Abusalomu ūja kū ng'wakwe, atazunīlījiwe ū kūja kwibona nū ntemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abusalomu kwikala mu Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu Isilaeli ī yose walī atīho munhū ūyo wakumīlījiagwa kūlwa wiza bokwe gīt'ūmo walī Abusalomu. Ū mīlī gwakwe gwalī gūtī na kabi nūūlū hado, kūfuma kū londooji lwa ntwe gwakwe kūshisha kū mhambala ja magūlū gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nzwīlī jakwe wajimoogaga kamò ū mu ng'waka, nguno jadidohaga ūlū jalīha no no no. Ūlū wajimooga wajipimaga ū būdito, jashisha kilo ibīlī na nusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabyalīlwa bitūnja badatū na nshīke ūmò; ū nshīke wakwe winhwa lina lya Tamali, nang'hwe aho wakūla ūbiza nkīma wa suso nsoga no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūlū ū Abusalomu wikala ū mu Yelusalemu myaka ībīlī ataalī kwibona nū ntemi būshū kū būshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū Abusalomu ūlagīja gīkī ū Yoabu ize antūme ū kūlī ntemi, alīyo ū Yoabu atizile; ūtūma lūkangala lwa kabīlī, ūleka nī hangī ū kwiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Abusalomu ūbawīla batūmami bakwe, “Bing'we angū mugūdeebile ū ngūnda go ng'wa Yoabu ūyo gūbīmbīkanilwe na gwane, ī haha būlīmo moi būsīga; jagi mukagūpembe moto.” Ng'hana a batūmami ba ng'wa Abusalomu būūkagūpemba moto ū ngūnda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Yoabu hū ūbūūka ūja ū kū ng'wa Abusalomu; ūūkamūja, “Bebe nibūlī a batūmami bako bagūpembile ū ngūnda gwane?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abusalomu ūhaya, “Ū nene naakūlagīlīgije gīkī, ‘Nzūgū nakūtūme ūje ū kūlī ntemi ūkamūje: Nibūlī nakiza ū kūfuma ī Geshuli? Yalī hambū hambū ūlū ni nataalī kūko nī haha!’ Alilūūlū, nalī na ng'hūmbū ja kūshika ū kū būtongi wa ntemi; ūlū nalī na būbi bose bose hambū hambū anibūlage dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yoabu ūja ū kūlī ntemi ūūkang'wīla ī yenīyo. Na lūūlū ū ntemi ūnagīlīja ū Abusalomu, wiza ūtuja mazwi ū kū būtongi wa ntemi, hanuma winama kūshisha ū būshū būkuumya hasī. Ū ntemi ūmbipa ū Abusalomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
